BIT-03: Read per-thread chemistry and solver state once

The chemistry and the RK5, ROS2 and Newton solvers keep their working
state in `#pragma omp threadprivate` globals. In a shared library on macOS
every access is a call to the thread-local-variable thunk: 12-18 % of the
unpatched run. Look the state up once per call and pass it down.

Requires: FIX-01
Results: identical (every concentration, the output file and the report are unchanged)

Apply from the root of an EPANET-MSX checkout at 85a303d, after FIX-01, FIX-02, BIT-01 and BIT-02:
    git apply --whitespace=nowarn BIT-03.patch
or use tools/build-msx.sh, which applies the series in order.

